# Check out text files with LF on every OS, whatever core.autocrlf says. run_all.mjs copies the
# handwritten files into the pack byte for byte, and every generated pack file uses LF
# (tests/PARITY.md, intended difference 1).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary inputs, if one is ever placed in the kit folder (the licensed PDF is also in .gitignore).
*.pdf binary
